<MakerLayout title="Free Bingo Card Generator — PARADOX Makers" description="Create a custom 5×5 printable bingo card from 24 words, names or prompts. Free, no account and browser-side."><GeneratorTool mode="bingo" title="Bingo Card Generator" intro="Make a custom 5×5 bingo card from 24 words, names, vocabulary items or prompts. Generate, print or save it as a PDF without creating an account." steps={['Enter 24 words, names or prompts, one per line.','Generate a randomized 5×5 card with a free center square.','Print the result or save the browser print view as PDF.']} faq={[["How many entries do I need?","A standard 5×5 card with a free center square needs 24 entries."],["Can I use names instead of bingo numbers?","Yes. Use names, vocabulary, topics, icebreakers or short phrases."],["Does it upload my list?","No. The generator runs in your browser tab."]]}/></MakerLayout>
